            "html": "<article id=\"post-26412\" class=\"post-26412 post type-post status-publish format-aside hentry post_format-post-format-aside category-diario tag-gender tag-hs38 tag-mother tag-tights tag-time tag-time-travelling tag-transexuality tag-what-if\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#diario\" rel=\"category\">Diário</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"reader.html#2019-08-05-genders-and-time-travelers.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">Genders and Time Travelers</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#aside\">Nota</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"reader.html#2019-08-05-genders-and-time-travelers.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2019-08-05T17:03:40-03:00\">05/08/2019</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"reader.html#2019-08-05-genders-and-time-travelers.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#gender\" rel=\"tag\">Gender</a> <a href=\"tag.html#hs38\" rel=\"tag\">HS38</a> <a href=\"tag.html#mother\" rel=\"tag\">Mother</a> <a href=\"tag.html#tights\" rel=\"tag\">Tights</a> <a href=\"tag.html#time\" rel=\"tag\">Time</a> <a href=\"tag.html#time-travelling\" rel=\"tag\">Time Travelling</a> <a href=\"tag.html#transexuality\" rel=\"tag\">Transexuality</a> <a href=\"tag.html#what-if\" rel=\"tag\">What If</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-26414\" src=\"https://estranhosidade.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/vtagmnd-copy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"566\" />Maybe I could go back in time and fix my life.. I would travel to the 90s and using fantastic futuristic technologies, I would get closer to my mom when she was pregnant of me, unbeknownst to her, I would spray her with a DNA-modifying virus that would change my DNA and I would have been born a beautiful baby girl. I would prevent my father from being laid off from the police, which I think it was what ultimately kill his spirit and took his life. I would save my mom from the religious fanaticism that she went through, and I would make sure we had much money, enough to have fuck-you-money, to not matter, to not be a problem. That&#8217;s what I would do… No gender doubts, no money problems, just a terrific life! My father would be alive, I would be a happy girl, and we all would be living in a nice house.</em></p>\n</div></article>",
